WEBVTT

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:48.360
I uh...

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:49.300
Yes?

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.270
A-About that rock.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:53.640
Yes?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.980
No, never mind.
Forget it.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:08.620
Kyoko finds a rock
inside her closet

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:14.790
and she asks Godai to find out
what kind of rock it is.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:18.600
He learns that it was
the only present...

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.490
Sichiro ever gave to Kyoko.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.170
And...

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:28.240
I'm going to pick up
the rock. Go on ahead.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.790
Merry Christmas!

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.560
I thought the party
was from seven?

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.320
Yes.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.930
Godai's late.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.640
It isn't seven yet

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:32.500
But it's "almost" seven.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.840
What's taking him so long?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.340
He'd better not try
to save money by not coming.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.910
He wouldn't do that.
He'll come.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:44.410
Let's have a drink while we wait.
Master, beer.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.080
Coming right up.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.080
Drink up!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.320
It's gotta be beer!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.620
Let's drink too.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.130
Merry Christmas.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.220
Welcome!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.790
Did you wait long?

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.220
You're late!

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.630
It's really snowing hard.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.460
Where's Yo-chan?

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.870
Headed for the hotel.

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:33.200
What about the cake?

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.060
Taken care of.
The champagne, too.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:37.930
Want to order something?

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.060
No thanks.
Let's go.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.710
FOOLS

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:47.680
This is our only chance
to party in a hotel suite.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:48.900
You said it.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:05:00.440
BIGGER FOOL

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.660
Yo, Godai.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.600
Did you find out?

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.390
Sure did..

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.000
And?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.770
Miss! Coffee for me.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:16.140
Out with it, Sakamoto!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:20.000
I did find out, but that rock...

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.820
I forgot it.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:22.610
What?

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.510
-Is it at your apartment?
-No.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.520
Enjoy.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.250
Thanks.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:29.810
Then where is it?!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:31.990
On the train.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.950
T-The train?

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:37.390
Sorry! I apologize.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.800
Forgive me!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.840
Maybe...

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.670
It's better this way.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.440
Sure!  It's just a rock.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.080
No sense making a big fuss
over just one rock.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:01.510
I'll pick up something
similar for you.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.060
Yes, that's right.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.150
Uh-huh... Yes, that's right.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.070
About 30 minutes ago,
on the train headed for Tokyo.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.970
Just a moment.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.730
Whereabouts was it?

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.470
Sort of toward the rear.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:23.970
What car number?

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.170
Don't know.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.370
Remember!

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:29.640
If I had a good memory,
I wouldn't have forgotten the package.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.080
Says it was towards the rear.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.520
I see. Thanks.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.990
Nobody turned it in.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:46.020
Well, we tried, right?
Let's go.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:50.690
Well, the train that stopped here
30 minutes ago...

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.270
would be returning from
Tokyo about now.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:58.070
You might try getting on it again
and looking around.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.550
Godai!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.810
Inbound train arriving
on Platform 8.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.280
On the overhead rack, right?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.010
Yeah.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.220
Around here?

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:08.840
Yeah.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:10.590
Yeah, I remember seeing
that kiosk.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:22.160
It's not here.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:26.390
Sakamoto, check the rear.
I'll check in front.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.800
Now just a minute.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.710
Excuse me, let me through.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:38.210
This is great!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.810
Let's party.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.000
Ms. Otonashi.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.330
No, you don't.
Look at me.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.730
What the--?!

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:58.730
Akemi.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:03.500
You're more fun than Godai.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.710
Would you get the phone, Akemi?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.410
Akemi?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:11.650
Darn!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:15.910
Yes?

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.250
Godai, is that you?

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.950
I had a slight mishap.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.290
It's going to take a bit longer.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.360
I don't know what time I'll get there.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:30.240
But I'll be there!
Please let the manager know.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:33.580
I'll give her the message.
Don't worry about it.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:37.130
Take your time,
nobody's gonna miss you.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.300
And also...

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:43.250
Here comes the next train!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.110
All right.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.700
Mishap?

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.350
Don't know what he meant
but those were his words.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.920
Worried?

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:53.750
Yes.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:55.960
I see.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.730
I asked Godai
to do me a favor.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.490
Is that so?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:10.330
Shinjuku Station. Shinjuku Station.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.840
Was that rock so valuable?

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:21.050
Not to me, but to the manager.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.890
Dammit!
Quit kidding around!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.160
Hey, are you listening?

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.130
Sakamoto.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:32.960
Yeah?

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.400
Let's check lost and found
one last time.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.940
Never can tell.

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:43.240
Oh, sure.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.940
I got a call
right after you left.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.070
They're holding it
at Tokyo Station.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.620
Isn't that great, Godai!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:17.000
I'm starving.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:20.550
How could anyone mistake
"rock" for "rocker"?!

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.310
He did have a thick accent.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:29.250
Geez, we wasted a trip,
but I guess it can't be helped.

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.070
We did everything we could.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.370
Hey, want me to come with you
to apologize?

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:49.300
Forget it. I dragged you
around enough already.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.670
Lunch will be on you.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:53.040
Now look, you!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:56.210
Just joking!
Don't get so huffy!

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:02.920
We were naive to think
anyone would turn it in.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.050
It's just a rock.

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:07.890
To anyone else,
it's just plain rubbish.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:17.670
If I found it and picked it up,
I'd just throw it away.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:20.700
Hey, Godai!

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:22.930
Godai!

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.280
Stop it!
People are watching.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.610
Help me look!

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.530
Found it!

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:53.900
You did? Great!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.640
Yeah! I found it!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.870
I'm happy for you!
Now let's go home!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:11:59.810
Yeah.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:08.820
W-Wait!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.260
My...My bag!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.020
Stop!
The present's inside!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.130
Bummer.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:40.550
All together now!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.250
Where are you going?

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.620
No running away!

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.990
Let's party!

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:49.020
Hey lover boy! No fair
keepin' Akemi to yourself!

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:51.460
Here we go!

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.000
Godai sure is late.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.840
I-I'm not...

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:03.100
I'm not waiting for him, really.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.740
What's wrong, manager? Why're you
acting like a lonely widow?

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.750
It's because Godai's not here!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:14.120
I'll share Coach Mitaka
so come join us!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.920
No thank you.
Go on without me.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.490
You sure? Okay.

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:38.170
What? You guys again?

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.700
Did they find my bag?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:41.910
We have it.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.510
A passenger found it.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.780
They're holding it at
Yotsuya Station.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:48.480
What?

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:50.760
Yotsuya?

00:13:56.600 --> 00:14:00.930
Brrr!  What's keeping that train?

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:03.130
Geez, it's cold!

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.830
Ouch!  It's too hot!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.940
Can I ask you to get it
for me?

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:10.640
Huh?

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.610
I don't have the energy
to go to Yotsuya.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.240
Sure.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.250
Appreciate it.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.980
I'll drop by your place
to pick it up later.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.660
Nothing inside that
you need right away?

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.300
No. Not anymore.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:21.780
Maybe I shouldn't go...

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:54.740
Just the two of us. Alone?!

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.920
Slow dance?

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.720
We'll set a time
to turn out all the lights...

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.620
and dance by the light
of the Christmas tree.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:11.130
What do you think?

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.000
I like it.
I'll go talk to the master.

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.060
Thanks.

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:22.360
Akemi! Save something
for when you get married!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.800
It's not what you think.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.500
He's right.
It was just a kiss.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.110
Just a kiss.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:32.850
-Oh my!
-Do the right thing!

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.040
Akemi!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:35.980
Just kidding!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:41.920
Come, Mr. Mitaka!

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:16.190
This ticket is good for one sweater.
I tried my best, but couldn't finish it.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:17.660
Please wait a bit longer.
Merry Christmas. -- Kozue.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.790
Chachamaru.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.360
Mr. Katayama?
No, he's not here today.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:57.000
No... Good-bye.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.110
I think it's a wonderful present.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:25.330
Is the traffic like this
all the way?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.700
Don't ask me.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:30.340
Can you let me off here?

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:37.170
What kind of ritual is this?

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:39.170
That's a secret.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:41.980
Let's drink with more feeling!

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.840
Aren't you going to dance
anymore, Mrs. Ichinose?

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.390
Okay, here goes.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.680
Godai might not be coming.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.690
Do you think so?

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:56.520
He wouldn't make it in time.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.830
-Come here, Coach Mitaka!
-H-Hey!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.890
Didn't you feel anything?

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:34.130
Like what?

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.200
You know...!

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:42.500
Godai, you are SO late!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:45.140
Must've been fooling around
with a girl somewhere.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.140
New arrivals have to drink
three rounds.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.340
We were getting tired
of waiting.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:51.140
Were you really waiting
for me?

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.440
We sure were!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.920
It's more fun teasing
a familiar plaything.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.380
The rock is a limestone.

00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:02.860
The specks are fossils of ancient
organisms called Fusulina.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:06.960
300 million years ago,

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.830
evey one of the specks
was a living thing.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.970
It's far more than
just an ordinay rock.

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:18.780
I think it was
a wonderful present.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:20.340
-- Godai.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:50.800
Ms. Otonashi...

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:52.910
You're smooth.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.550
You're staying with me tonight.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.910
Oh, you're so forward!

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:34.750
Godai!

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:41.810
Manager...

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.090
What happened, Godai?

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.530
I just...

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:47.660
Why're you here, Manager?

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:52.770
Because you left so suddenly.

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:10.150
You knew, didn't you?

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:13.320
You knew...

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:16.590
that the rock
was a present from Soichiro?

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:23.360
Little Ikuko told me.

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:26.160
I...

00:22:28.350 --> 00:22:30.040
I don't know why...

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:32.950
but my heart beat anxiously
as I waited for you.

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:39.140
If I had known...

00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:42.860
how anxious it would
make me feel...

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:51.940
If I had known...

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:55.830
I should have never have
asked you about the rock.

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:00.570
I'm not saying this
very well, but -

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:01.940
It's okay.

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:19.490
Shall we go home?

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:20.150
Yes.

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:23.390
I'll always cherish this card.

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:31.830
What do you say we take
the long way home?

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:32.770
Let's!

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:51.840
Mrs. Ichinose, it's time
for the preview.

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:54.550
Let's make it
a good one!

00:23:54.730 --> 00:23:56.220
It's New Years!

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:58.060
I feel like going
to a hot spa!

00:23:58.140 --> 00:24:02.160
Next:
"Kyoko in a Hot Spring... Hot-cha-cha!
Case of the Outdoor Peeping Tom"

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:04.760
Peeping? At what?!

00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:06.630
That should be obvious.
